<title>USA: Collins to repurchase up to one mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Collins to repurchase up to one mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Kansas 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collins Industries Inc said Wednesday it adopted a plan to repurchase up to one million shares, or 14 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>Collins, which makes ambulances, buses and trucks, said it currently has about 7.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
